---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import Photo from '../components/Photo.astro';
import Reviews from '../components/Reviews.astro';
import { business, yearsInBusiness } from '../data/site';
import { breadcrumbSchema } from '../lib/schema';
---
<Base
  title="About TC Decks | Levi Tippetts, Utah County Deck Builder Since 2005"
  description={`TC Decks is a family-owned deck builder in Saratoga Springs, Utah, run by Levi Tippetts since ${business.founded}. Licensed & insured, Utah contractor license #${business.license}.`}
  schema={[breadcrumbSchema([{ name: 'About', path: '/about' }])]}
>
  <PageHero eyebrow="About us" title="A local, family-owned deck builder" lead={`Levi Tippetts started TC Decks in ${business.founded}. ${yearsInBusiness} years later, we're still a small Saratoga Springs company where the owner designs your deck and stays involved until it's done.`} crumbs={[{ name: 'About', path: '/about' }]} />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap grid grid-2">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Levi's story</h2>
        <p>Levi's love of building started when he was 14. Every day after school he walked home and picked up a tool to help his dad build the family's new home. By the time the last nail went in, he was hooked.</p>
        <p>Building runs in the family. Levi is a third-generation builder. His grandfather, Calvin Tippetts, built and sold homes and had a house in the very first Utah Valley Parade of Homes. His dad, Kevin Tippetts, served as head contractor for Habitat for Humanity in Utah County.</p>
        <p>Levi learned the trade framing houses for Scott Bradford, a family friend and co-owner of Acadian Builders. Before long he started his own framing company and built homes and businesses across Utah, California and Idaho.</p>
        <p>Then he found decks, and he hasn't looked back. A deck is where families and friends gather outdoors, and Levi loves the details that turn one into a beautiful part of the home: a clean picture-frame border, stairs that flow to the yard, lighting that makes evenings last.</p>
        <p>He also loves the people side of building. For four years Levi hosted the podcast for the Utah Valley Home Builders Association, which connected him with the community and his fellow builders. Today he's a TimberTech Platinum Pro and was recently invited to join the Owens Corning <a href="/oc-lumber">OC Lumber Pro Build Team</a>.</p>
        <h2>Working with Levi</h2>
        <p>Homeowners mention Levi by name in review after review, for his attention to detail, fast communication and patience while they figure out exactly what they want. That's how TC Decks works: you deal with the person responsible for your project from the first phone call to the final walkthrough.</p>
        <p>It's a family business, too. Levi's wife and daughters built a deck for the Utah Valley Parade of Homes as part of <a href="/project-showcase#all-woman-build">The House that She Built</a>, an all-woman build.</p>
        <p>One of our Pleasant Grove decks, with a twisty slide off the second story, was featured on the <a href="/project-showcase#pleasant-grove-trex-slide">cover of Deck Specialist magazine</a> (<a href="https://issuu.com/building-products/docs/deckspecialist_fall_2021_for_issuu" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Fall 2021 issue</a>).</p>
        <h2>Levi on podcasts and video</h2>
        <p>Besides hosting the UVHBA podcast, Levi has been a guest on a few others, talking about running a contracting business and what he has learned along the way.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/50-employees-zero-profit-a-contractors-wake-up-call/id1798112963?i=1000742309837" target="_blank" rel="noopener">50 Employees, Zero Profit: A Contractor’s Wake-Up Call</a>, on the Dr. Decks podcast</li>
          <li><a href="https://share.google/HdStAfRF5b1iygP9y" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Another interview with Levi</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://share.google/OPk8ngu5kPpQKL6Ju" target="_blank" rel="noopener">TENS 4 // Levi Tippetts from TC Decks</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://open.spotify.com/episode/5iFBmZr7ojWuoomCKl2bOq" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Levi on the Ultimate Deck Shop Podcast</a> (Spotify)</li>
          <li><a href="https://open.spotify.com/episode/1Szvmh4IrmCkZPcYcQGUrs" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Levi on the Left of the Lake Podcast</a> (Spotify)</li>
          <li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/reel/DZ_Q8stMPo0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Levi on the OC Lumber Pro Build Team trip to Gulfport</a> (Instagram)</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>What you can expect</h2>
        <ul class="check-list">
          <li>A free estimate over the phone</li>
          <li>A 3D design of your deck once your project is booked</li>
          <li>Cleanup handled for you</li>
          <li>Regular updates, including when suppliers cause delays</li>
          <li>A 7-year workmanship warranty plus manufacturer <a href="/certified-pro-installer">labor and material</a> warranty coverage</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>Credentials</h2>
        <ul class="check-list">
          <li>Utah Contractor License #{business.license}</li>
          <li>Licensed and insured</li>
          <li><a href="/certified-pro-installer">Certified Pro Installer</a>: TimberTech Platinum Pro, plus Trex, Deckorators and Fortress Railing</li>
          <li>Part of the Owens Corning <a href="/oc-lumber">OC Pro Build Team</a> for Glas-Powered OC Lumber</li>
          <li>Member of the North American Deck and Railing Association (NADRA), the NAHB and the local Home Builders Association</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <Photo src="/images/projects/covered-deck-roof/covered-deck-roof-framing-1" alt="TC Decks crew framing a roof over a second-story deck" />
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section alt"><div class="wrap"><h2>What customers say about Levi</h2><Reviews /></div></section>
</Base>
